sequenceDiagram
	autonumber
	participant Finance as Finance\n(Azure Durable Functions)
	participant Kafka as Kafka Broker\n(CloudEvents JSON)
	participant Notif as Notification\n(.NET 11 Worker)
	participant Redis as Redis\n(Idempotency Guard)
	participant Smtp as Mailpit / SendGrid\n(SMTP :587)
	participant DLQ as Kafka DLQ\n(notification.dead-letter-queue)

	Finance ->> Kafka: Publish PlaceOrder / CompleteOrder / CancelOrderCommand (key: OrderId)
	Kafka ->> Notif: Deliver CloudEvents command
	Notif ->> Redis: Atomic SET NX idempotency:{handler}:{eventId} (TTL 24h)

	alt Duplicate event ID
		Redis -->> Notif: Key already exists (skip)
	else New event ID
		Redis -->> Notif: Lock acquired

		alt Recipient email is null or blank
			Notif ->> Notif: Skip email rendering and send
		else Valid recipient email
			Notif ->> Notif: Render Orders/OrderEmail.mjml + _Layout.mjml (Mjml.Net)
			Notif ->> Smtp: MailKit SMTP submit (Polly circuit breaker + jitter retry + 30s timeout)

			alt Transient SMTP failure after Polly retries
				Smtp -->> Notif: Failure
				Notif ->> Redis: Release idempotency key
				Notif -->> Kafka: Wolverine retry (50ms / 250ms / 1s jitter)
				Kafka ->> DLQ: Route exhausted message (7-day retention)
			else Accepted by SMTP server
				Smtp -->> Notif: 250 OK (SMTP accepted)
			end
		end
	end
